      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"immediate, quiet space\"... thats exactly it. i just want the noise to stop. the constant judgment, the hate, the feeling that i have to keep defending a version of myself that doesn't even exist anymore. it feels like there's no way to actually fix this. everything is ruined. i just want to fade out.",
